# Architecture Decision Records

This directory contains ADRs (Architecture Decision Records) documenting significant architectural decisions made in this project.

## Format

ADRs should follow a consistent format:
- Filename: `NNNN-title-with-dashes.md` (e.g., `0001-use-postgresql-triggers.md`)
- Content: Context, Decision, Consequences

## Guidelines

- Record decisions that have long-term impact on the system
- Keep ADRs immutable - use new ADRs to supersede old ones
- Link related ADRs for traceability
